        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une tempête de sable blesse tous les Pokémon pendant\ncinq tours, sauf ceux de type Roche, Sol ou Acier.\nAugmente la Défense Spéciale des Pokémon Roche.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Sandsturm für fünf Runden. Schadet Pokémon aller\nTypen außer Gestein, Boden und Stahl. Erhöht die\nSpezial-Verteidigung von Gesteins-Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tormenta de arena que dura cinco turnos y hiere a\ntodos, excepto a los de tipo Roca, Tierra y Acero,\ny aumenta la Defensa Especial de los de tipo Roca.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Causa una tempesta di sabbia per cinque turni che\ndanneggia tutti i tipi esclusi Terra, Roccia e Acciaio.\nAumenta la Dif. Speciale dei Pokémon di tipo Roccia.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A five-turn sandstorm is summoned to hurt all\ncombatants except Rock, Ground, and Steel types.\nIt raises the Sp. Def stat of Rock types.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
